<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    :root { --line:#333; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background:#f0f1f3; color:#111; }

    .screen-note { max-width: 720px; margin: 1rem auto; padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 8px;
      background:#fff4e0; color:#8a5a00; border:1px solid #f0d8a0; }
    .screen-note.blocked { background:#fce8e6; color:#b3261e; border-color:#f5c6c2; }
    .bar { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 1rem; display:flex; gap:.6rem; }
    .bar button, .bar a { padding:.5rem 1rem; border:none; border-radius:6px; background:#1f6feb; color:#fff; cursor:pointer; font-size:.95rem; text-decoration:none; }
    .bar a.sec { background:#e6eaef; color:#111; }

    /* Standard 501 approximate check size (~175mm x 80mm). */
    .check {
      position: relative; width: 175mm; height: 80mm; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line); padding: 6mm 8mm; overflow:hidden;
    }
    .check .row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; }
    .drawer { font-weight:700; font-size: 3.4mm; }
    .drawer small { display:block; font-weight:400; color:#444; }
    .bankbox { text-align:left; font-size: 3mm; }
    .date { margin-top: 3mm; font-size: 3mm; }
    .date .box { display:inline-block; min-width:34mm; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); text-align:center; }
    .payee { margin-top: 5mm; font-size: 3.4mm; }
    .payee .line { display:inline-block; min-width:120mm; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-weight:700; }
    .amountbox { position:absolute; top: 20mm; left: 8mm; border:1.5px solid var(--line);
      padding: 1mm 3mm; font-weight:700; font-size: 4mm; }
    .words { margin-top: 4mm; font-size: 3.2mm; }
    .words .line { display:inline-block; min-width:150mm; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
    .foot { position:absolute; bottom: 12mm; left:8mm; text-align:center; font-size:2.6mm; color:#333; }
    .foot .sig { min-width:45mm; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:1mm; }
    .memo { position:absolute; bottom: 12mm; right:8mm; font-size:2.8mm; }

    /* Bank-approved MICR font (commit the licensed file here to activate — see fonts/README.txt).
       Self-hosted, so it satisfies the app's font-src 'self' CSP. Absent → falls back to Courier. */
    @font-face { font-family: 'MICR'; src: url('/fonts/micr.woff2') format('woff2'),
      url('/fonts/micr.woff') format('woff'); font-display: swap; }
    /* MICR line — a PLACEHOLDER (Courier) until the approved font is installed and both flags on. */
    .micr { position:absolute; bottom: 3mm; right:8mm; left:8mm; text-align:center;
      font-family: "Courier New", monospace; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 4mm; color:#111; }
    .micr.ready { font-family: 'MICR', "Courier New", monospace; letter-spacing: 4px; }
    .micr small { display:block; font-family:Arial; letter-spacing:normal; font-size:2.4mm; color:#b3261e; }

    /* DRAFT watermark (shown until bank-approved). */
    .watermark { position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      transform: rotate(-18deg); pointer-events:none; }
    .watermark span { font-size: 14mm; font-weight:800; color: rgba(179,38,30,.16);
      border:3px solid rgba(179,38,30,.22); padding: 2mm 6mm; border-radius:4mm; white-space:nowrap; }

    @media print {
      body { background:#fff; }
      .screen-note, .bar { display:none !important; }
      .check { border:none; margin:0; }
      @page { size: 210mm 99mm; margin: 8mm; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <% if (!approved) { %>
    <div class="screen-note blocked">
      <strong>טיוטה — אינו צ׳ק סחיר.</strong> הדפסת צ׳קים אמיתית דורשת אישור בנק וקידוד MICR
      (E-13B) מאושר (🔴 §11.5, §10.3). שורת ה-MICR כאן היא placeholder בלבד ואינה נקראת ע"י הבנק.
      לאחר אישור הבנק — הגדר <code>CHECK_PRINTING_APPROVED=true</code> והוסף גופן MICR מאושר.
    </div>
  <% } else if (!micrReady) { %>
    <div class="screen-note">
      מצב "מאושר" פעיל, אך גופן ה-MICR עדיין לא הותקן — התחייב את קובץ הגופן ב-
      <code>src/public/fonts/micr.woff2</code> והגדר <code>CHECK_PRINTING_MICR_FONT=1</code>.
      עד אז שורת ה-MICR היא placeholder.
    </div>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="screen-note" style="background:#e7f6ec;color:#1a7f37;border-color:#bfe6cb">
      מוכן להדפסה. ודא התאמה לתקן 501 ולפריסת ה-MICR מול הבנק לפני הפקה בכמות.
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="bar">
    <button onclick="window.print()">הדפס</button>
    <a class="sec" href="/payments/<%= payment.id %>">חזרה לצ׳ק</a>
  </div>

  <div class="check">
    <% if (!approved) { %><div class="watermark"><span>טיוטה · לא סחיר · DRAFT</span></div><% } %>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="drawer">
        <%= account.company_name %>
        <small>ח.פ. <%= account.company_tax_id || '—' %></small>
      </div>
      <div class="bankbox">
        בנק <%= account.bank_name %><br />
        סניף <%= account.branch %> · חשבון <%= account.account_number %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="date">תאריך: <span class="box"><%= formatDate(payment.payment_date) %></span></div>

    <div class="amountbox">₪ <%= formatIls(payment.amount) %></div>

    <div class="payee">שלמו ל: <span class="line"><%= payees.join(', ') || '—' %></span></div>
    <div class="words">הסך של: <span class="line"><%= amountWords %></span></div>

    <div class="memo">
      צ׳ק מס' <%= payment.check_number %><br />
      <% if (payment.lines && payment.lines.length) { %>עבור <%= payment.lines.length %> חשבוניות<% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="foot"><div class="sig">חתימה מורשה</div></div>

    <div class="micr <%= micrReady ? 'ready' : '' %>">
      <%= micrLine %>
      <% if (!micrReady) { %><small>שורת MICR — placeholder בלבד, עד להתקנת גופן MICR מאושר אינה נקראת ע"י הבנק</small><% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
